; PLEASE KEEP THE MINGW/COREDLL*.DEF AND W32API/LIBCE/COREDLL*.DEF
; FILES IN SYNC.
; COREDLL import surface for Windows CE .NET 4.2 (arm-wince-mingw32ce)
; Base: Windows CE 4.2 shared source, private/winceos/coreos/core/dll/coredll.def.
; Parsing policy: ARM retail (x86/PPC/MIPS/SH and DEBUG blocks excluded),
; every @CESYSGEN branch included (superset surface: individual devices
; export only what their OS image was built with), and NONAME
; (ordinal-only) exports omitted -- they cannot be resolved by a
; name-based import library.
; Augmented with the Pocket PC 2003 SDK coredll.lib name exports
; (C++-mangled WM-line IME internals).
; Restored TlsAlloc/TlsFree per MSDN ("TlsAlloc"/"TlsFree", Link Library:
; Coredll.lib, "Windows CE 1.0 and later"): the device/SDK dump these defs were
; verified against omitted them (the same gap the CE 5.0 coredll.def records),
; but they are coremain coredll exports on every CE generation and clang's
; emulated TLS (__emutls_get_address) imports TlsAlloc/TlsFree, so a CE 4.2 program
; using thread_local would fail to link without them.
; The EXPORTS keyword that a case-insensitive sort of the export list had
; stranded between `exp' and `ExtCreateRegion' is removed: llvm-dlltool
; lexes a bare EXPORTS as a section keyword, so it silently re-entered the
; export list and was harmless -- but a module-definition file permits
; exactly one EXPORTS, and a stricter consumer would reject the file.
; 1744 name exports.

LIBRARY COREDLL
EXPORTS
??0exception@std@@QAA@ABV01@@Z
??0exception@std@@QAA@PBD@Z
??0exception@std@@QAA@XZ
??0type_info@@AAA@ABV0@@Z
??1exception@std@@UAA@XZ
??1type_info@@UAA@XZ
??2@YAPAXI@Z
??2@YAPAXIABUnothrow_t@std@@@Z
??3@YAXPAX@Z
??3@YAXPAXABUnothrow_t@std@@@Z
??4exception@std@@QAAAAV01@ABV01@@Z
??4type_info@@AAAAAV0@ABV0@@Z
??8type_info@@QBAHABV0@@Z
??9type_info@@QBAHABV0@@Z
??_7exception@std@@6B@
??_7type_info@@6B@
??_L@YAXPAXIHP6AX0@Z1@Z
??_M@YAXPAXIHP6AX0@Z@Z
??_N@YAXPAXIHP6AX0@Z1@Z
??_U@YAPAXI@Z
??_U@YAPAXIABUnothrow_t@std@@@Z
??_V@YAXPAX@Z
??_V@YAXPAXABUnothrow_t@std@@@Z
?__set_inconsistency@@YAP6AXXZP6AXXZ@Z
?_inconsistency@@YAXXZ
?_Nomemory@std@@YAXXZ
?_query_new_handler@@YAP6AHI@ZXZ
?_query_new_mode@@YAHXZ
?_set_new_handler@@YAP6AHI@ZP6AHI@Z@Z
?_set_new_mode@@YAHH@Z
?_Xlen@std@@YAXXZ
?_Xran@std@@YAXXZ
?before@type_info@@QBAHABV1@@Z
?DefaultImcGet@@YAKXZ
?DefaultImeWndGet@@YAPAUHWND__@@XZ
?ImmGetUIClassName@@YAPAGXZ
?ImmProcessKey@@YAKPAUHWND__@@IJKI@Z
?ImmSetActiveContext@@YAHPAUHWND__@@KH@Z
?ImmTranslateMessage@@YAHPAUHWND__@@IIJHIIPAH@Z
?name@type_info@@QBAPBDXZ
?nothrow@std@@3Unothrow_t@1@B
?raw_name@type_info@@QBAPBDXZ
?set_new_handler@@YAP6AXXZP6AXXZ@Z
?set_terminate@std@@YAP6AXXZP6AXXZ@Z
?set_unexpected@std@@YAP6AXXZP6AXXZ@Z
